{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not inspect input when collection is disabled**\n\nEven with `content.input(false)`, this traverses the input before the handler, invoking getters and allocating a copy that will never be emitted. Side-effecting getters can alter handler behavior. Check `includeInput` before snapshotting and add a disabled-input test using a side-effecting payload.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7s0a2g","finding_digest":"f74add3470e39517380d2850cc17c0f303247036b98764326c11164511677391","finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","line":120,"observation_digest":"c621e85c70aacabb697ad6b2b351915f29aaed2f7b8f2b45d308d9bd4d80c965","observation_id":"aro_v1_yyq6qxdqvlflw2l222zlgumrl4","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","published_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_scztmzrchxwvclkurodp4sbyjj","reviewed_base_sha":"479f023a672bf03f84703cde341df7b48c8eb72a","reviewed_head_sha":"7f3bdc4e67fc71884846370ed3fa3b98f5eb4842","reviewer":"codex","start_line":119,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_u6z4ubodfi7caiyzqcdvoska6x","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T21:26:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
